'''Large Red Ball''' (大玉 (赤) ''Ōdama (Aka)'', '''Large Ball (Red)''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Large Red Ball
|image = E 577.png
|appearance = [[River City Stages#River City Ball-Rolling|River City Ball-Rolling]]<br>
[[New Year's Bling]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 6|Infernal Tower - Floor 6]]
|money drop = 100¢ - 395¢
}}

==Enemy==
Although rather pathetic in the early stages, when this enemy starts appearing in huge hordes, especially with their Knockback effect, they become an actual threat. The best way to counter this enemy is by using [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red units]] such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple]].

==Strategy==
Assuming they don't move forward at all, Crazed Fish and Fish Cat actually have the perfect attack rate to infinitely knockback Red Ball, making it a piece of cake to deal with. Alternatively, using [[:Category:Cats with Knockback Immunity|units with Knockback Immunity]] or a longer range than its Omni Strike will make it practically unable to push.

